## Finish
Stop owned background tools with `fulcrum task terminal stop {{thread}} --all-owned --json`, then run `fulcrum finish --bead {{bead}} --thread-id {{thread}} --ownership-operation {{ownership_operation}} --outcome ready_for_review --input - --json` with `summary`, exact `source_oid`, `checks`, and `evidence`. Once accepted, stop implementation. If blocked, use outcome `blocked` with `summary`, `blocker`, `attempts`, and `required_action`.
